  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Hei Lou Lan later tells Fang Yuan that Immortal Gu Dark Limit, held by Gu Immortal Jiang Yu, can conceal aura, hide heavenly secrets, and protect from deductions, and that her Great Strength True Martial Physique was sealed with its help.",
        "chapters": [
          649
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan recalls from his previous life that it can conceal aura and obstruct calculations.",
        "chapters": [
          653
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "A later comparison states its effect is to make the Gu Immortal be overlooked and to make others fail in the deduction.",
        "chapters": [
          820
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later names it his only dark path Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1356
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When someone deduces about him, Fang Yuan uses dark limit Immortal Gu to resist that power. Each activation needs a long rest before the Gu can be used again.",
        "chapters": [
          1211
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "activation-limit",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Once his dark path attainment rises to grandmaster, Fang Yuan works out that dark limit Immortal Gu and perseverance Immortal Gu can serve as the cores of a new immortal killer move that conceals him.",
        "chapters": [
          1340
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "new-concealment-killer-move",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_perseverance_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He creates it as extended dark concealment, with rank six dark limit Immortal Gu and rank seven perseverance Immortal Gu as its cores and several hundred mortal Gu greatly lengthening dark limit Immortal Gu’s effect.",
        "chapters": [
          1346
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "new-concealment-killer-move",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_mortal_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "feeding": {
    "known": false,
    "food_raw": null,
