  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Hei Bai says Hei Cheng sent Hei Lou Lan to be adopted by Fairy Jiang Yu so her Immortal Gu Dark Limit could preserve Hei Lou Lan’s life under the Great Strength True Martial physique.",
        "chapters": [
          528
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_hei_bai",
          "char_hei_cheng",
          "char_hei_lou_lan",
          "char_fairy_jiang_yu",
          "sys_great_strength_true_martial_physique"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Hei Lou Lan uses dark limit Immortal Gu and still begins to feel unable to suppress that physique, needing a strength path Immortal Gu to advance to Gu Immortal realm.",
        "chapters": [
          530
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "seal-on-hei-lou-lan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Northern plains Gu Immortals know Fairy Jiang Yu as a dark path Gu Immortal who holds dark limit Immortal Gu, which can conceal inspirations and make deductions difficult. Fairy Jiang Yu used it to seal the aura of one of the ten extreme physiques on Hei Lou Lan so heaven and earth would not induce that physique.",
        "chapters": [
          692
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "seal-on-hei-lou-lan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "reg_northern_plains"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "As Fang Yuan’s fame in Southern Border rises after he draws close to Qiao Si Liu, attempts to deduce him grow rapidly, and it becomes very difficult to deal with the situation using dark limit Immortal Gu alone.",
        "chapters": [
          1321
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rising-deductions-outpace-it-alone",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "reg_southern_border",
          "char_qiao_si_liu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "To make a super Gu formation that can hold off grey night, Fang Yuan contributes dark limit Immortal Gu, which flies out with many mortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1356
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "given-to-the-super-gu-formation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_super_gu_formation"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "As Fairy Zi Wei contests control of that super Gu formation, he judges that he can no longer take dark limit Immortal Gu back.",
        "chapters": [
          1360
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "given-to-the-super-gu-formation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fairy_zi_wei"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "With dark limit Immortal Gu lost, heaven’s will can now monitor him at all times.",
        "chapters": [
          1383
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "given-to-the-super-gu-formation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After the battle of the giant dream realm, the Gu has fallen into Heavenly Court’s hands.",
        "chapters": [
          1393
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "given-to-the-super-gu-formation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_heavenly_court"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fairy Zi Wei later says she has dark limit Immortal Gu, a crucial clue to Fang Yuan, yet still cannot deduce his location.",
        "chapters": [
          1554
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "given-to-the-super-gu-formation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
